            <div xml:id="m-65126620-5a42-43c5-8f64-24a63bca0495">
              <lg xml:id="m-895cb252-66ea-43aa-a41c-40a5d0177b0d">
                <l xml:id="m-ed5f7b0a-f363-4142-8aab-fc3be3481520" facs="#m-31ef9a1f-6403-4fb4-8ae2-2e210b3279d6" label="ambiguous">462</l><l xml:id="m-925d62d3-83ae-4608-9980-6b27a5dae450" facs="#m-3a421408-899c-4605-86e9-f79c34ff15d8" label="text-like">The Epiphany of our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-7bd051bd-dcf1-476b-aeb1-7614a4d756b6" facs="#m-bea2ef5a-e4de-4d8b-9cd9-4c35b6770a3c" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-7dd345c4-8456-42e0-b63d-94fad7bf8b41" facs="#m-baad862d-3518-47a1-be6f-fc001a297c3f" label="lyrics-like">yCclésiae tuae, quaésumus Dó- munéribus declarátur, immolátur</l><l xml:id="m-b3ce3833-4325-4b9f-8f65-a2097ae33bd0" facs="#m-886a4223-832f-4b99-8137-b9a96be403b7" label="lyrics-like">et súmitur, Jesus Christus Filius</l><l xml:id="m-14472c1d-e72b-4882-a6d2-f566d4be6bc5" facs="#m-8f9efe9a-02f4-4474-89ea-680e72a26d5c" label="lyrics-like">U mine, dona propítius intuére:</l><l xml:id="m-2baaa6cd-8ea0-4e8d-8461-b3e6b4499707" facs="#m-c2bb9385-c453-4d8d-8695-6014a93dabd8" label="lyrics-like">tuus Dóminus noster: Qui tecum</l><l xml:id="m-efdf1802-53e8-4b16-89f2-c95c72e2174e" facs="#m-c6322d49-ccb5-4ab5-b2f5-716df62f2ba6" label="ambiguous">quibus non jam aurum, thus, et</l><l xml:id="m-b5fcfa48-25b8-4422-8a6d-f5feeb9a92bd" facs="#m-82669673-9c06-4811-933d-a693d3c141f1" label="lyrics-like">myrrha profértur; sed quod essdeml vivit.</l><l xml:id="m-c95773dd-1898-42d7-9018-b63a8c84390f" facs="#m-0a5e2262-fdc8-418f-861f-91a4a7d275a0" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-13d1a6ba-8f10-4e8f-9887-7c766c1aab1b" facs="#m-167d2706-859e-4477-8787-2fa014ca3888" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-d687b8b6-e08a-4bb1-8717-99e7f515ee5d" facs="#m-cd63fac6-0c58-4c05-8573-cbe44beeba7f" label="lyrics-like">*stéllam éjus in O-ri-énte, et vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b828758-4bfe-44ed-a017-0d5e9af772df" facs="#m-ce1fb9d4-4a75-4f69-b35d-ab8bcc41344e" label="ambiguous">* I-di-mus</l><l xml:id="m-bb303ef2-b97f-40b2-b0f7-c8c082481cce" facs="#m-18d74cb3-36fa-4970-9aae-06659e9e719d" label="lyrics-like">Dómi- num.</l><l xml:id="m-47721575-f3e9-4fb2-9b45-5e86876d0644" facs="#m-a0e56e53-d5fe-4b93-8f09-b13d6b4e0ac9" label="lyrics-like">nimus cum muné-ri¬ bus</l><l xml:id="m-ab9e96b1-4419-4856-8ec3-00923d47ce89" facs="#m-0238f961-8092-4f46-9fc2-1085b2555f42" label="lyrics-like">adoráre</l><l xml:id="m-456f51d8-57c7-4151-a1f1-901736f99cce" facs="#m-fec0be50-4b3d-4a04-abb8-c4ee2ad09ee3" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-c2c9a834-59f5-44d5-ac8b-9a033802571e" facs="#m-01dcf692-2628-4161-9394-f2e4fff9440e" label="lyrics-like">Raesta, quaésumus omnípotens ] intelligéntia consequámur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1aa1b427-8cca-4c1f-b15a-2e1336fb55a3" facs="#m-2d03ad97-39b6-4a82-9bf3-47397d2c8d59" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: ut quae solémni cele- minum.</l><l xml:id="m-4942face-4b93-42ac-9643-447272e21303" facs="#m-8cdca416-ee4f-4798-9d48-13979241304a" label="lyrics-like">brámus officio, purificátae mentis</l><l xml:id="m-47805f71-83b5-405c-bcf9-13d4f247f190" facs="#m-3bc5efe4-69f9-420a-92b8-ae5044caa872" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-a2ed51a6-0c9c-4e99-a387-b479f522a79d" facs="#m-709bb2e7-4281-4e81-9a25-d9500e2b5c6f" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Apértis thesáuris. p. 463.</l><l xml:id="m-6e931eae-8115-4bfb-8031-b16dc453908d" facs="#m-ef558635-7925-4691-82d8-6d73366c7f8d" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-6caf97d4-73b9-4d05-898d-2febc7bc0472" facs="#m-32c80f35-1b66-47dd-b4bd-1b3d0091fac9" label="ambiguous">Isaias. 60.</l><l xml:id="m-3f1847dd-5652-430c-be4b-c19a933d5e28" facs="#m-f7b17574-3540-4cb5-8ec9-c99485c235f6" label="lyrics-like">Eva in circúitu óculos tuos, et ! longe vénient, et filiae tuae de lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e026bc5-73c4-42e9-b94b-57da7b48f427" facs="#m-1215e1dd-3672-4eea-b4b1-0b2a23a75414" label="lyrics-like">Il vide:t omnes isti congregáti tere surgent.</l><l xml:id="m-fb91b2ae-0f43-4255-a1a2-3ae55ed36b0f" facs="#m-c794e309-af19-4db6-b807-706e114a534e" label="lyrics-like">sunt, venérunt tibi:*filii tui de</l><l xml:id="m-d1eab3db-9fa6-477a-8650-72a97b338965" facs="#m-0d875a96-9dc3-4fda-909f-7e7038d4f783" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-04ce4792-2fd4-4508-93a6-6db4737a5ab7" facs="#m-6c7738da-500d-4fe6-86ff-74ca27f3bd34" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-0c28055f-5c21-4295-86f8-4d6ae1ed2c68" facs="#m-8a61f5e4-5c75-4626-a757-07e0dcb7a0c6" label="lyrics-like">-mnes de Sába véni-ent: “Alle-lú-ia, alle lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-e1e73868-fce1-45ec-bfda-185f61f2c9ca" facs="#m-7cf4c30f-d7a7-4d53-896e-a3ef36fba0fe" label="lyrics-like">V. Aurum et thus de feréntes. Gló-ri-a Pátri. p. 458.</l><l xml:id="m-3a520ff8-e126-4866-ad8e-837c824ce58a" facs="#m-fabf25cb-a7eb-4103-befc-8667f927cb62" label="lyrics-like">V. Adoráte Dóminum, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-cffa30f4-ae41-4ce7-a1b3-7d476f060c74" facs="#m-964cdc1a-c049-4b14-9b77-7727b8effe7c" label="lyrics-like">R. In áula sáncta éjus, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-77e832a5-70f4-4491-94bc-2bd4de735197" facs="#m-d88f3a21-22ab-4e14-b5bb-1d14c72b4a6b" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-32610ed7-d8a6-499c-b29e-6a8b7a0ada7b" facs="#m-a5af6dc7-c14f-450e-809b-3a259016923e" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Stélla ista. p. 464.</l><l xml:id="m-5ec8ad11-65b0-44fb-aaeb-ba96b7ad6dd8" facs="#m-916ca901-e932-4def-b9ce-7380a387fc05" label="ambiguous">Isaias. 60.</l><l xml:id="m-2cbf1b03-db74-4bfc-982c-737f7aa6c951" facs="#m-6bc370ff-efc0-44c3-a7a2-075a54c943d8" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-cca1692b-1185-4feb-926b-159476f561ea" facs="#m-c94600fe-34ec-46a7-98a8-18b176589c45" label="lyrics-like">Mnes de Saba vénient, t aurum Dómino annuntiántes.</l><l xml:id="m-f39f52d5-ca55-4056-9a5f-db164b8e8902" facs="#m-f8482afd-24ec-4160-be81-d510ccdb029a" label="lyrics-like">U et thus deferéntes, “et laudem</l></lg>
